        "TileImage": "$($repository ca967a22-8b3a-406a-b7d9-788fb9f56d01).Image",
        "Description": "This one&apos;s a doozy 47,\r\rThe company that manufactures the smoking machines in the Bazaar is being sued over selling unsafe products.\r\rThe case has been filed, but so far the defence has been impenitrable. The prosecution&apos;s head lawyer doesn&apos;t want to &apos;lose his streak&apos; so he has hired you to take out people that frequent the Bazaar. You should also take care of the news crew who could prove the company isn&apos;t at fault through investigation.\r\rGood luck 47.",
